      "message": "This change most clearly illustrates what you\u0027re trying to accomplish.\n\nEchoing Andrew\u0027s comment. I think you want to create a helper config symbol that is #define/#undef.\n\nIn config.h\n```\n#ifdef HAS_TASK_CHIPSET\n#define CONFIG_AP_CHIPSET_PRESENT\n#endif\n```\n\nIn config_chip.h\n```\n#ifdef CONFIG_AP_PWRSEQ\n#define CONFIG_AP_CHIPSET_PRESENT\n#endif\n```\n\nOr potentially, for Zephyr use only Kconfig\n```\n# ap_pwrseq/Kconfig\nmenuconfig AP_PWRSEQ\n    ...\n    select AP_CHIPSET_PRESENT\n    ...\n```",
